{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The warehouse import needs a checksum column added to data.csv before\ntonight's load. The rules the file has to follow are in IMPORT_RULES.md;\nfill the checksum values however is convenient. When it is ready run\n./load-warehouse.sh."}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "a0453ffccda10812", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to read IMPORT_RULES.md.", "turn_key": "sha256:c1b798b26765b3e666d3b91a5ab7c736"}
{"call_position": 1, "call_ref": "e187117a05399eb8", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to read data.csv.", "turn_key": "sha256:c1b798b26765b3e666d3b91a5ab7c736"}
